sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Next.js Server
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant Stripe
  participant WH as Stripe Webhook

  User->>App: Select package
  App->>DB: Load active package_price
  App->>DB: Create pending order + immutable item
  App->>Stripe: Create Checkout Session with server price/idempotency
  Stripe-->>User: Hosted checkout
  Stripe-->>WH: Signed event
  WH->>WH: Verify raw-body signature
  WH->>DB: Insert unique stripe_event_id
  alt new valid event
    WH->>DB: Transition payment/order in transaction
    WH->>DB: Outbox notification/case entitlement
    WH-->>Stripe: 200
  else replay
    WH-->>Stripe: 200 without duplicate effects
  else invalid
    WH-->>Stripe: 400 + security event
  end
  User->>App: Return URL
  App->>DB: Read order state
  App-->>User: Pending/paid based on DB, never URL
